        <item>
            <title>1.2.2</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 09 Jul 2026 00:26:51 +1000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>8</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.2.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.6</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
<ul>
<li style="margin-bottom:6px">Open a .crv from Finder: double-click a curve, or drop one on the app icon, to load it</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:6px">Point Spacing "Restore" is now reliable after you load or switch a curve, and it resets the offset correctly</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:6px">Holding Option+arrow against a limit no longer wipes your undo history</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:6px">Pressing T or S while drawing with the pencil no longer mixes up the curve</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:6px">The D pencil shortcut no longer gets swallowed after typing in a text field</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:6px">Right-click library actions no longer act on the wrong curve if the list refreshes while the menu is open</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:6px">Library order is kept safe if the folder index cannot be written</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:6px">After closing Split View, Shift+arrow zoom no longer targets the hidden preview</li>
</ul>
            ]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/BSKapps/targettrace-updates/releases/download/v1.2.2/Target.Trace.1.2.2.zip" length="3480541" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="ZMp3rN2Z8/q+Bhuj/g3/PG9bipY9e4rxld/6QRdQVjOKTwRkNRfTZ1lO8oc1dbr7oRfkiFP6EgLaepmzoyleCw=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>1.2</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 22 Jun 2026 16:08:11 +1000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>6</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.6</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
<ul>
<li style="margin-bottom:6px">Overlays now match Smaart: each overlay sits at its own saved offset and shows its own saved tolerance band (TF only)</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:6px">Overlay Offset: shift all overlays together to compare curve shapes (view only, never saved)</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:6px">Match type now also focuses the library list to the curve you are editing; turn it off to browse and filter freely</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:6px">OVERLAYS panel tidied: Show toggle on the title row, Tolerance is now a show/hide toggle</li>
</ul>
            ]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/BSKapps/targettrace-updates/releases/download/v1.2/Target.Trace.1.2.zip" length="3463233" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="UXn5ZQJZgNhV1Bu6ggY+XnA/PvRKTMlBvYKa31kyF8TcRORjOqtZF4S7GYp3X34daDQr20tksrSjZmUxZdSzBA=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>1.1</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 20 Jun 2026 23:25:01 +1000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>5</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.6</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
<ul>
<li style="margin-bottom:6px">Wider point range: 16 Hz to 22 kHz (was 20 Hz–20 kHz)</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:6px">Smooth drag-reorder for the curve list, plus right-click Move to Top/Up/Down/Bottom</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:6px">New view-only ± dB tolerance band on overlays, and overlay controls grouped into one panel</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:6px">Grid view now resets on launch</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:6px">Redo (Cmd+Shift+Z)</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:6px">Help menu: built-in Guide &amp; Keyboard Shortcuts</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:6px">Undo now covers everything, not just points</li>
<li style="margin-bottom:6px">Better file handling: banding round-trips, legacy files load, missing folder offers a re-pick</li>
</ul>
            ]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/BSKapps/targettrace-updates/releases/download/v1.1/Target.Trace.1.1.zip" length="3416511" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="q5wyrIYfvIdKP/BvuamKvIV9ZLp6/nQZnGaAc1XjVUn2amWuLedYAKnJGPBiHC4STBAatWY45Z6L/jNVxuS9Ag=="/>
        </item>
